{"title":"2012 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_3\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Problem 3</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The positive integers are arranged in rows and columns, as shown, and described below.\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><i>An image is supposed to go here.  You can help us out by creating one and <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit\">editing it in</a></span>.  Thanks.</i>\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p>The odd numbered rows list six positive integers in order from left to right beginning in column B. The even numbered rows list six positive integers in order from right to left beginning in column F.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Parts\">Parts</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Parts\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_3a\" title=\"2012 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 3a\">2012 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 3a</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_3b&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2012 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 3b (page does not exist)\">2012 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 3b</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_3c&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2012 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 3c (page does not exist)\">2012 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 3c</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_3d&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2012 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 3d (page does not exist)\">2012 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 3d</a></li></ul>\n\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017230515\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.011 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.018 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 19/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 407/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    6.070      1 Template:Image_needed\n100.00%    6.070      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:36978:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017230515 and revision id 285877. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}